[00:20.24]Many are the weaknesses
[00:24.46]That we all possess.
[00:31.99]Still Jehovah cares for us,
[00:38.50]Loves us nonetheless.
[00:44.18]He is so merciful;
[00:51.16]His love, so powerful.
[00:58.86]May we show this kind of love,
[01:05.32]Help those in distress.
[01:11.14]Some at times are weak in faith,
[01:26.94]Strong though they appear.
[01:32.66]By our reassuring words,
[01:40.02]We can calm their fears.
[01:46.28]Weak ones to God belong;
[01:52.76]His spirit makes them strong.
[01:59.08]May we feel their pain and cares,
[02:05.38]Help them dry their tears.
[02:26.12]Rather than condemn the weak,
[02:27.95]We should bear in mind
[02:29.32]How much we can strengthen them
[02:31.31]By our being kind.
[02:32.37]May we be diligent,
[02:33.52]Give them encouragement.
[02:35.12]As we lend our kind support,
[03:33.78]Comfort they will find.
